Description: Enables TLS 1.2 for the legacy iOS 5/6 EAP client
 Fixes WPA2-Enterprise (PEAP/TTLS) joins on networks whose RADIUS
 server requires TLS 1.2, such as ANU-Secure / eduroam.
 .
 Raises only the maximum TLS version for EAP client contexts, so
 re-authentication can still negotiate downward instead of dropping
 the link. Certificate validation, CA anchors, server-name checks
 and credentials are untouched.
 .
